---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Masuk" description="Masuk ke ZonaPas — pilih Kelola Berita atau Redaksi.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-4 pt-10 pb-6">
    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-[#0A2540] dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white">&larr; Kembali ke Beranda</a>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black text-[#0A2540] sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Masuk</h1>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-3 h-1.5 w-16 rounded-full bg-[#FACC15]"></div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[560px] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Pilih salah satu untuk melanjutkan. Kedua pilihan memakai akun yang berbeda.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a
        href="/kelola-berita/"
        class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#FACC15] hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:hover:border-[#FACC15]"
      >
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0A2540] text-[#FACC15]">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z" /></svg>
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Kelola Berita</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Tulis, ubah, dan hapus berita langsung di situs.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Masuk dengan akun GitHub
        </p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-bold text-[#0A2540] group-hover:underline dark:text-[#FACC15]">
          Buka Kelola Berita <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/redaksi/login"
        class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#FACC15] hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:hover:border-[#FACC15]"
      >
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0A2540] text-[#FACC15]">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-[#0A2540] dark:text-white">Redaksi</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Dashboard redaksi dengan peran Administrator, Penyunting, dan Penulis.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Masuk dengan akun Google/Gmail. Penyunting dan Penulis masuk lewat undangan.
        </p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-bold text-[#0A2540] group-hover:underline dark:text-[#FACC15]">
          Buka Redaksi <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
      Belum punya akses? Silakan hubungi kami melalui halaman <a href="/kontak/" class="font-bold text-[#0A2540] hover:underline dark:text-white">Kontak</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
